flowchart TD
  Office[ConstructionService completed office] --> Bundle[One actual construction-only T01 utility identity; finite full tank]
  Bundle --> Trucks[Office-owned ConstructionTruckService on rear event clock]
  Haul[Rear selects actual pending-site M11 haul + idle assigned hauler] --> Trucks
  Trucks --> Claims[Existing source claim + actor destination-space promise]
  Claims --> Load[Same worker: walk, pick up <=25kg, carry, load actual truck]
  Load --> Driver[Scoped ledger utility station; no qualification grant]
  Driver --> Travel[Clear rear vehicle route; T01 speed and measured fuel burn]
  Travel --> Unload[Same worker physically carries <=25kg portions to actual site]
  Unload --> Return[Empty truck returns; safe station exit and same worker released]
  Trucks --> Stop[Cancel, office retirement, pending duty, obstruction]
  Stop --> Recover[Release unpicked claims; retain and physically unload cargo to recoverable local pile]
  Fuel[Existing Vehicles physical M08 refuel command] --> Bundle
  Trucks --> Fallback[Foot haul with explicit no-office, busy, route or fuel reason]
  Bundle --> Boundary[Excluded from ordinary fleet, dispatch, passengers and P08 exception]
